  "model": "openai/text-embedding-3-small",
  "input": "As of now, which team is responsible for feature-flags?\n[2026-04-21] handover/2026-04-21-feature-flags: The feature flag service has a new home: the Atlas team. The Dune team kept it until today. [2026-01-29] handover/2026-01-29-feature-flags: Handover: as of today the feature flag service moves from Cinder to team Dune. Yuki walked Farah Haddad through the runbook this morning. [2025-10-21] standup/atlas/2025-10-21: New dependency for the billing service: the feature flag service. Billing-api will gate the new invoice flow behind feature-flags; the reasoning is that the rollout needs a per-tenant kill switch.",
